  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 425°F (220°C).",
    "Prepare the ssam-wraps by cutting them into quarters and heating them on a dry pan for a few minutes.",
    "In a blender, mix together the coconut sugar, almond milk, coconut cream, and French vanilla extract.",
    "Add the raspberry puree, fresh lavender flowers, and lemon zest to the blender and blend until smooth.",
    "Pour the mixture into a saucepan and heat it over low heat until warm and fragrant.",
    "Gradually add the dark rum to the saucepan and stir well.",
    "Pour the sauce into the preheated ssam-wraps and fold them to form a neat package.",
    "Place the packages on a hot stone plate and garnish with fresh berries and mint leaves.",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy!"
